## Hartwig and Siegel Severity Assessment Scale

* Severity Rating: Level 6 - Severe
* Classification Criteria: Any ADR that causes permanent damage, structural disability, or requires major surgical intervention to repair damage caused by the reaction.
* Clinical Justification: The reaction led to structural disruption (complete Achilles tendon rupture) requiring open orthopedic surgical reconstruction, cast immobilization, and long-term physical rehabilitation.
